                "text": "Today, during a @HouseAgGOP subcommittee hearing, I noted that we fully funded animal health initiatives in President Trump's \"One, Big, Beautiful Bill.\"\n\nThese investments will defend agriculture from foreign animal disease outbreaks and promote food and farm security. https://t.co/j40YAnqwZR",
