                "text": "Yesterday, I met with Dr. Rodger Main who is the Director of the Veterinary Diagnostic Lab at Iowa State University.\n\nHe testified before @HouseAgGOP about the importance of the VDL & the National Animal Health Laboratory Network to defending Iowa ag from foreign animal diseases. https://t.co/KGx1HZQbiZ",
