                "text": "Foreign animal diseases are an ever-present threat to agriculture.\n\nWe must prioritize investments that keep our food supply safe and protect our farms from financial ruin.\n\nI'm glad that we fully funded animal health initiatives in President Trump's \"One, Big, Beautiful Bill.\" https://t.co/S4ysRkgUBL",
