                "text": "It was great to welcome Matt Schuiteman from Sioux County to D.C. for a @HouseAgGOP hearing on California\u2019s ridiculous #Prop12 mandates on Iowa hog farmers.\n\nMatt testified about the negative impacts that #Prop12 has on hog health and the financial stability of hog farms in Iowa. https://t.co/ztIwP01oMN",
