                "text": "I\u2019m glad that our Ag & Manufacturing Liaison \u2014 Wes \u2014 could attend the 75th anniversary celebration of the Lyon County Soil and Water Conservation District.\n\nThis organization helps protect soil health, keep our water clean, and support our farming community. https://t.co/lMZIb4yiUR",
