                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "During National Community Health Center Week, I\u2019m glad that our Regional Director \u2014 Abby \u2014 could visit All Care Health Center in Council Bluffs.\n\nOur \u201cOne, Big, Beautiful Bill\u201d invests $50 billion into rural hospitals and health centers, which will strengthen healthcare in Iowa. https://t.co/wsXB0vgjuk",
